   "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n## Copilot review overview\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe focused accessibility fix is correct and covered by an appropriate unit test.\n\n**Review effort:** Balanced  \n**Findings:** None\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nHides decorative ActionList icons from screen readers, preventing VoiceOver from announcing invalid glyphs.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Marks item icons and submenu indicators as `aria-hidden`.\n- Adds regression coverage for both elements.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `src/​vs/​platform/​actionWidget/​browser/​actionList.ts` | Hides decorative glyph elements from assistive technology. |\r\n| `src/​vs/​platform/​actionWidget/​test/​browser/​actionList.test.ts` | Verifies both elements have `aria-hidden=\"true\"`. |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 Configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
